    "input": {
      "body": "Hi Michael,\n\nFollowing my note about keeping the client experience personal at MW Law, I wanted to share a short article on AI adoption.\n\nIts main point is that buying AI is easier than changing how a team works. Clear ownership, shared information, and human review matter as much as the tool. That's shaping our work with PI firms at Possible Minds.\n\nhttps://getpossibleminds.com/t/6QMTTn-_pA\n\nFor MW Law, which seems harder: finding the right tool or fitting it into the team's existing routines? I'd value your perspective.\n\nBest,\nPranav\nFounder, Possible Minds",
      "subject": "Re: A client-trust question for MW Law",
